    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βο-ῶπις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤψ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ox-eyed</i>, i.e. <i>having
				large, full eyes</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῶπις πότνια Ἥρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.551
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				403
			</span></i>; of Artemis, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				10.99
			</span></i>; Amphitrite, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				16.110
			</span></i>; Harmonia, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.91
			</span></i>; of women, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.144
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.40
			</span></i>:—masc. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοώπης</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				768.43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψ</span>) 
				=
